<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<title>muud view — third-party notices</title>
<style>
  body { background:#F4F3EF; color:#0D0D0D; font: 13px/1.5 ui-monospace, Consolas, monospace; max-width: 860px; margin: 40px auto; padding: 0 20px; }
  h1 { font: 800 40px/1 system-ui, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.02em; margin: 0 0 8px; }
  h2 { font: 800 16px/1.2 system-ui, sans-serif; margin: 0 0 6px; }
  section { border: 1px solid #0D0D0D; padding: 16px; margin-top: -1px; }
  ul { padding-left: 18px; margin: 6px 0 10px; }
  pre { white-space: pre-wrap; border-top: 1px dotted #0D0D0D; padding-top: 10px; font-size: 11.5px; }
  .pill { display:inline-block; border:1px solid #0D0D0D; border-radius:999px; padding:2px 10px; margin-right:6px; }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<h1>THIRD-PARTY NOTICES</h1>
<p>muud view is MIT licensed. It is built with the open-source software listed below.
The bundled fonts, Inter Tight and IBM Plex Mono, are under the SIL Open Font License 1.1 (see the OFL-*.txt files).</p>
<p>{{#each overview}}<span class="pill">{{name}} × {{count}}</span>{{/each}}</p>
{{#each licenses}}
<section>
  <h2>{{name}}</h2>
  <ul>{{#each used_by}}<li>{{crate.name}} {{crate.version}}</li>{{/each}}</ul>
  <pre>{{text}}</pre>
</section>
{{/each}}
</body>
</html>
